            "factKeys",
          ],
          "type": "object",
        },
        "strict": true,
        "type": "function",
      },
      {
        "description": "Save a reviewable draft-only mission proposal only after all mission fields, approved source IDs, relevant verified fact IDs, channels, period, campaign type, profile version, primary CTA and official target URL are known. This does not execute the mission.",
